---
args: { input: CaseInput, goal: GoalContract, policy: PolicySelection, evidencePlan: EvidencePlan, previous: RepairAssignment[] }
returns: PreparedEvidence
---
Prepare a bounded, source-versioned evidence slice for coordinateWork. Sequence inspection, parts procurement, repair, and verification under approved procedures. Reserve shared tools, obtain consent for cost or scope changes, and preserve an explicit stop-and-escalate path when findings exceed the original plan. Include direct observations, current authority, contrary evidence, a plausible rival interpretation, and missing decisive fields. Carry forward the actual prior-stage records when provided.
